  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridging Grant - Caritas Makeni</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Makeni in partnership with CAFOD is anticipating a three year grant from the EC for the implementation of livelihoods activities in Bombali district. The anticipated  EC grant, in addition to other funding windows of Caritas Makeni supporting livelihoods programs, require adequate logistical capacity and effective community sensitization for sustainable outcomes ahead of project implementation. To this end, and cognizant of the need for a sound foundation before commencement of implementation, Caritas Makeni requires a bridging grant to fill institutional capacity gaps and to set up a robust sensitization campaigns on community based livelihoods options. Caritas Makeni has proven to be a strategic partner of CAFOD and as such requires adequate and appropriate capacity to implement livelihoods projects in a professional and sustainable manner.</narrative>
  </description>
